{"version": "https://jsonfeed.org/version/1.1", "title": "SONiC \u975e\u516c\u5f0f\u30c9\u30ad\u30e5\u30e1\u30f3\u30c8", "home_page_url": "https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/", "feed_url": "https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/feed_json_updated.json", "description": "SONiC NOS\uff08sonic-net/SONiC\uff09\u306e\u65e5\u672c\u8a9e\u975e\u516c\u5f0f\u30c9\u30ad\u30e5\u30e1\u30f3\u30c8", "icon": null, "authors": [], "language": "ja", "items": [{"id": "https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/_meta/changelog/", "url": "https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/_meta/changelog/", "title": "\u5909\u66f4\u5c65\u6b74", "content_html": "\u5909\u66f4\u5c65\u6b74 \u2014 \u3053\u306e\u30da\u30fc\u30b8\u306f merged PR \u306e\u30e1\u30bf\u30c7\u30fc\u30bf\u304b\u3089 meta/scripts/gen_changelog.py \u3067\u6a5f\u68b0\u751f\u6210\u3055\u308c\u3066\u3044\u307e\u3059\u3002\u624b\u3067\u7de8\u96c6\u3057\u306a\u3044\u3067\u304f\u3060\u3055\u3044\u3002", "image": "https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/assets/images/social/_meta/changelog.png", "date_modified": "2026-06-06T14:38:36+00:00", "date_published": "2026-05-11T18:29:31+00:00", "authors": [], "tags": ["changelog", "meta"]}, {"id": "https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/_meta/sitemap/", "url": "https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/_meta/sitemap/", "title": "\u30b5\u30a4\u30c8\u30de\u30c3\u30d7", "content_html": "\u30b5\u30a4\u30c8\u30de\u30c3\u30d7 \u2014 docs/**/*.md \u3092 mkdocs nav \u9806\u3067\u968e\u5c64\u5217\u6319\u3057\u305f\u30a4\u30f3\u30c7\u30c3\u30af\u30b9\uff08\u5168 1098 \u30da\u30fc\u30b8\uff09\u3002meta/scripts/gen_sitemap.py \u3067\u81ea\u52d5\u751f\u6210\u3002", "image": "https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/assets/images/social/_meta/sitemap.png", "date_modified": "2026-06-06T14:38:36+00:00", "date_published": "2026-05-11T22:06:05+00:00", "authors": [], "tags": ["meta", "sitemap"]}, {"id": "https://aoki-ta