tion-extension-infrastructure/", "url": "https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/architecture/sonic-application-extension-infrastructure/", "title": "SONiC Application Extension Infrastructure\uff08sonic-package-manager / SPM\uff09", "content_html": "SONiC Application Extension Infrastructure\uff08sonic-package-manager / SPM\uff09 \u2014 3rd-party / \u4efb\u610f\u306e docker \u30b3\u30f3\u30c6\u30ca\u3092\u300cSONiC application extension\u300d\u3068\u3057\u3066 inbox \u6a5f\u80fd\u3068\u540c\u3058\u7ba1\u7406\u9762\u3067\u6271\u3046\u305f\u3081\u306e\u30d5\u30ec\u30fc\u30e0\u30ef\u30fc\u30af\u3002manifest \u691c\u8a3c\u30fbFEATURE \u767b\u9332\u30fbhostcfgd \u9023\u643a\u306e\u6d41\u308c\u3068\u5236\u7d04\u3092\u6574\u7406\u3059\u308b\u3002", "image": "https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/assets/images/social/architecture/sonic-application-extension-infrastructure.png", "date_modified": "2026-06-06T14:38:36+00:00", "date_published": "2026-05-10T01:13:33+00:00", "authors": [], "tags": []}, {"id": "https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/categories/mib-snmp/", "url": "https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/categories/mib-snmp/", "title": "MIB / SNMP \u95a2\u9023", "content_html": "SONiC \u306f Net-SNMP + sonic_ax_impl (AgentX subagent) \u3067 SONiC \u56fa\u6709 MIB \u3092\u5b9f\u88c5\u3057\u3001\u8a2d\u5b9a\u306f CONFIG_DB \u306e SNMP / SNMP_COMMUNITY / SNMP_USER / SNMP_AGENT_ADDRESS_CONFIG \u30c6\u30fc\u30d6\u30eb\u306b\u79fb\u884c\u6e08\u307f\u3002", "image": "https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/assets/images/social/categories/mib-snmp.png", "date_modified": "2026-06-06T14:38:36+00:00", "date_published": "2026-05-10T06:47:34+00:00", "authors": [], "tags": []}, {"id": "https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/internals/support-multiple-user-defined-redis-database-instances/", "url": "https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/internals/support-multiple-user-defined-redis-database-instances/", "title": "\u8907\u6570 Redis \u30a4\u30f3\u30b9\u30bf\u30f3\u30b9\u306e\u30e6\u30fc\u30b6\u5b9a\u7fa9\uff08database_config.json \u3067 DB \u3092\u5206\u6563\uff09", "content_html": "\u8907\u6570 Redis \u30a4\u30f3\u30b9\u30bf\u30f3\u30b9\u306e\u30e6\u30fc\u30b6\u5b9a\u7fa9\uff08database_config.json \u3067 DB \u3092\u5206\u6563\uff09 \u2014 \u5f93\u6765\u306e SONiC \u306f \u5358\u4e00\u306e Redis \u30a4\u30f3\u30b9\u30bf\u30f3\u30b9 \u306b APPL_DB / ASIC_DB / CONFIG_DB / STATE_DB \u7b49\u3092\u3059\u3079\u3066\u8f09\u305b\u3066\u3044\u305f\u3002", "image": "https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/assets/images/social/internals/support-multiple-user-defined-redis-database-instances.png", "date_modified": "2026-06-06T14:38:36+00:00", "date_published": "2026-05-09T18:22:50+00:00", "authors": [], "tags": []}, {"id": "https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/platform/sonic-fw-utility/", "url": "https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/platform/sonic-fw-utility/", "title": "fwutil\uff08platform component firmware \u306e install / update / show\uff09", "content_html": "BIOS\u30fbCPLD\u30fbFPGA\u30fbBMC\u30fbSSD \u306a\u3069\u306e\u30d7\u30e9\u30c3\u30c8\u30d5\u30a9\u30fc\u30e0\u30b3\u30f3\u30dd\u30fc\u30cd\u30f3\u30c8\u306e\u30d5\u30a1\u30fc\u30e0\u30a6\u30a7\u30a2\u3092\u7d71\u4e00 CLI\uff08fwutil install / update / show\uff09\u3067\u7ba1\u7406\u3059\u308b\u305f\u3081\u306e\u30e6\u30fc\u30c6\u30a3\u30ea\u30c6\u30a3\u8a2d\u8a08\u3092\u89e3\u8aac\u3059\u308b\u3002", "image": "https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/assets/images/social/platform/sonic-fw-utility.png", "date_modified": "2026-06-06T14:38:36+00:00", "date_published": "2026-05-10T01:22:06+00:00", "authors": [], "tags": []}, {"id": "https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/reference/glossary/", "url": "https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/reference/glossary/", "title": "\u7528\u8a9e\u96c6 (Glossary)", "content_html": "\u7528\u8a9e\u96c6 (Glossary) \u2014 SONiC NOS \u3067\u983b\u51fa\u3059\u308b\u56fa\u6709\u7528\u8a9e\u30fb\u7565\u8a9e\u30fb\u30b3\u30f3\u30dd\u30fc\u30cd\u30f3\u30c8\u540d\u30fb\u30c7\u30fc\u30bf\u30d9\u30fc\u30b9\u540d\u30fb\u30c7\u30fc\u30e2\u30f3\u540d\u3092\u3001\u30a2\u30eb\u30d5\u30a1\u30d9\u30c3\u30c8\u9806\u306b\u6574\u7406\u3057\u305f\u65e5\u672c\u8a9e\u7528\u8a9e\u96c6\u3067\u3059\u3002\u5404\u30a8\u30f3\u30c8\u30ea\u306f\u300c\u7528\u8a9e / \u7565\u79f0 / \u65e5\u672c\u8a9e\u8a33 / \u7c21\u6f54\u306a\u8aac\u660e / \u95a2\u9023\u30da\u30fc\u30b8\u300d\u306e\u5f62\u5f0f\u3067\u8a18\u8f09\u3057\u3066\u3044\u307e\u3059\u3002", "image": "https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/assets/images/social/reference/glossary.png", "date_modified": "2026-06-06T14:38:36+00:00", "date_published": "2026-05-11T18:14:52+00:00", "authors": [], "tags": []}, {"id": "https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/reference/cli/show-mgmt-vrf/", "url": "https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/reference/cli/show-mgmt-vrf/", "title": "show mgmt-vrf \u30b5\u30d6\u30b3\u30de\u30f3\u30c9", "content_html": "show mgmt-vrf \u30b5\u30d6\u30b3\u30de\u30f3\u30c9 \u2014 show mgmt-vrf \u306f\u7ba1\u7406 VRF (mgmt) \u306e\u6709\u52b9\u30fb\u7121\u52b9\u72b6\u614b\u3001Linux \u4e0a\u306e VRF \u30c7\u30d0\u30a4\u30b9\u60c5\u5831\u3001\u30eb\u30fc\u30c6\u30a3\u30f3\u30b0\u30c6\u30fc\u30d6\u30eb\u3092\u8868\u793a\u3059\u308b\u3002", "image": "https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/assets/images/social/reference/cli/show-mgmt-vrf.png", "date_modified": "2026-06-06T14:38:36+00:00", "date_published": "2026-05-11T06:01:44+00:00", "authors": [], "tags": []}, {"id": "https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/reference/yang/sonic-bgp-aggregate-address/", "url": "https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/reference/yang/sonic-bgp-aggregate-address/", "title": "sonic-bgp-aggregate-address YANG", "content_html": "sonic-bgp-aggregate-address YANG \u2014 SONIC BGP aggregate address configuration module.", "image": "https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/assets/images/social/reference/yang/sonic-bgp-aggregate-address.png", "date_modified": "2026-06-06T14:38:36+00:00", "date_published": "2026-05-10T06:59:09+00:00", "authors": [], "tags": []}, {"id": "https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/reference/yang/sonic-wred-profile/", "url": "https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/reference/yang/sonic-wred-profile/", "title": "sonic-wred-profile YANG", "content_html": "sonic-wred-profile YANG \u2014 Weighted Random Early Detection (WRED) \u30d7\u30ed\u30d5\u30a1\u30a4\u30eb\u3092\u540d\u524d\u4ed8\u304d\u3067\u4fdd\u6301\u3059\u308b\u3002\u8272 (green/yellow/red) \u6bce\u306e min/max \u95be\u5024\u3001\u30c9\u30ed\u30c3\u30d7\u78ba\u7387\u3001 ECN \u6709\u52b9\u5316\u3001 WRED \u6709\u52b9\u5316\u3092\u4fdd\u6301\u3059\u308b\u3002", "image": "https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/assets/images/social/reference/yang/sonic-wred-profile.png", "date_modified": "2026-06-06T14:38:36+00:00", "date_published": "2026-05-11T07:06:13+00:00", "authors": [], "tags": []}, {"id": "https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/switching/brief-introduction-of-iccp-code/", "url": "https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/switching/brief-introduction-of-iccp-code/", "title": "ICCPd \u5185\u90e8\u69cb\u6210\uff08MC-LAG / MLACP FSM \u30d5\u30a1\u30a4\u30eb\u5225\u30de\u30c3\u30d7\uff09", "content_html": "ICCPd \u5185\u90e8\u69cb\u6210\uff08MC-LAG / MLACP FSM \u30d5\u30a1\u30a4\u30eb\u5225\u30de\u30c3\u30d7\uff09 \u2014 SONiC \u306e MC-LAG\uff08Multi-Chassis LAG\uff09\u306f\u5c02\u7528\u30c7\u30fc\u30e2\u30f3 ICCPd\uff08ICCP daemon\u3001docker-iccp \u30b3\u30f3\u30c6\u30ca\u5185\uff09\u3067\u5b9f\u88c5\u3055\u308c\u3066\u3044\u308b\u3002", "image": "https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/assets/images/social/switching/brief-introduction-of-iccp-code.png", "date_modified": "2026-06-06T14:38:36+00:00", "date_published": "2026-05-09T14:58:21+00:00", "authors": [], "tags": []}, {"id": "https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/switching/sonic-ip-lag-incremental-update/", "url": "https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/switching/sonic-ip-lag-incremental-update/", "title": "IP / LAG / MTU \u306e Incremental Update\uff08portmgrd / intfmgrd / teammgrd \u5206\u62c5\uff09", "content_html": "SONiC \u306e port / IP / LAG / MTU \u3092 CONFIG_DB \u304b\u3089 incremental \u306b\u6d41\u3059\u30e2\u30c7\u30eb\u3068\u3001portmgrd / intfmgrd / teammgrd \u306e\u8cac\u52d9\u5206\u62c5\u3092\u89e3\u8aac\u3059\u308b\u3002", "image": "https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/assets/images/social/switching/sonic-ip-lag-incremental-update.png", "date_modified": "2026-06-06T14:38:36+00:00", "date_published": "2026-05-09T14:30:50+00:00", "authors": [], "tags": []}, {"id": "https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/system/secure-upgrade/", "url": "https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/system/secure-upgrade/", "title": "Secure Upgrade\uff08image \u7f72\u540d\u691c\u8a3c / SECURE_UPGRADE_MODE\uff09", "content_html": "SONiC image \u3092 CMS (Cryptographic Message Syntax) \u7f72\u540d\u3067 build \u304b\u3089 install \u307e\u3067\u6539\u7ac4\u304b\u3089\u5b88\u308b Secure Upgrade (SU) \u306e\u4ed5\u7d44\u307f\u3002SECURE_UPGRADE_MODE \u306b\u3088\u308b dev / prod / no_sign \u5207\u66ff\u3001sonic-installer \u3068 ONIE \u7d4c\u8def\u3067\u306e\u691c\u8a3c\u30d5\u30ed\u30fc\u3001Secure Boot \u3068\u306e\u9023\u643a\u3092\u6271\u3046\u3002", "image": "https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/assets/images/social/system/secure-upgrade.png", "date_modified": "2026-06-06T14:38:36+00:00", "date_published": "2026-05-09T23:27:26+00:00", "authors": [], "tags": []}, {"id": "https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/topics/04-vrf-ecmp/", "url": "https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/topics/04-vrf-ecmp/", "title": "VRF / ECMP / RIB-FIB \u30d1\u30a4\u30d7\u30e9\u30a4\u30f3", "content_html": "VRF / ECMP / RIB-FIB \u30d1\u30a4\u30d7\u30e9\u30a4\u30f3 \u2014 SONiC \u306e L3 \u8ee2\u9001\u3092\u300cVRF \u3068 interface \u3092\u4f5c\u308b\u300d\u300croute \u304c FRR \u304b\u3089 APPL_DB \u306b\u6765\u308b\u300d\u300corchagent \u304c RIF / next hop / route object \u3092 ASIC \u306b\u4f5c\u308b\u300d\u300cECMP \u306e\u7a2e\u985e\u3092\u9078\u3076\u300d\u306e\u9806\u3067\u8aad\u307f\u76f4\u3059\u7ae0\u5165\u53e3\u3002", "image": "https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/assets/images/social/topics/04-vrf-ecmp/index.png", "date_modified": "2026-06-06T14:38:36+00:00", "date_published": "2026-05-10T10:53:10+00:00", "authors": [], "tags": []}, {"id": "https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/topics/04-vrf-ecmp/operations/", "url": "https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/topics/04-vrf-ecmp/operations/", "title": "Route / Interface / Counter \u306e\u78ba\u8a8d", "content_html": "Route / Interface / Counter \u306e\u78ba\u8a8d \u2014 L3 \u306e\u969c\u5bb3\u8abf\u67fb\u3067\u306f\u3001\u6700\u521d\u306b route \u3060\u3051\u3092\u898b\u3066\u3082\u539f\u56e0\u3092\u7d5e\u308c\u307e\u305b\u3093\u3002VRF\u3001interface\u3001RIB\u3001FIB\u3001RIF counter\u3001flow counter \u306e\u9806\u306b\u3001control-plane \u3068 data-plane \u306e\u5dee\u3092\u5206\u3051\u3066\u78ba\u8a8d\u3059\u308b\u904b\u7528\u30da\u30fc\u30b8\u3067\u3059\u3002", "image": "https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/assets/images/social/topics/04-vrf-ecmp/operations.png", "date_modified": "2026-06-06T14:38:36+00:00", "date_published": "2026-05-10T10:53:10+00:00", "authors": [], "tags": []}, {"id": "https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/topics/06-l2-vlan-lag/", "url": "https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/topics/06-l2-vlan-lag/", "title": "L2 / VLAN / LAG / MC-LAG", "content_html": "L2 / VLAN / LAG / MC-LAG \u2014 \u3053\u306e\u7ae0\u306f\u3001SONiC \u3092 L2 switch \u3068\u3057\u3066\u8aad\u3080\u3068\u304d\u306b\u6700\u521d\u306b\u8ff7\u3046\u300cVLAN\u3001VLAN interface\u3001switchport\u3001sub-port\u3001LAG\u3001MC-LAG \u306f\u3069\u306e\u9806\u756a\u3067\u7406\u89e3\u3059\u308c\u3070\u3088\u3044\u304b\u300d\u3092\u6574\u7406\u3059\u308b\u5165\u53e3\u3067\u3059\u3002", "image": "https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/assets/images/social/topics/06-l2-vlan-lag/index.png", "date_modified": "2026-06-06T14:38:36+00:00", "date_published": "2026-05-10T10:52:45+00:00", "authors": [], "tags": []}, {"id": "https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/topics/10-gnmi-openconfig/", "url": "https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/topics/10-gnmi-openconfig/", "title": "gNMI / gNOI / OpenConfig / YANG", "content_html": "gNMI / gNOI / OpenConfig / YANG \u2014 \u3053\u306e\u7ae0\u306f\u3001SONiC \u306e\u300c\u30e2\u30c7\u30eb\u99c6\u52d5\u7ba1\u7406\u300d\u3092\u3001\u30ea\u30af\u30a8\u30b9\u30c8\u304c\u5165\u308b\u5165\u53e3\u304b\u3089 ConfigDB \u306b\u5230\u9054\u3059\u308b\u307e\u3067\u306e\u9806\u3067\u8aad\u307f\u76f4\u3059\u305f\u3081\u306e\u5165\u53e3\u3067\u3042\u308b\u3002", "image": "https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/assets/images/social/topics/10-gnmi-openconfig/index.png", "date_modified": "2026-06-06T14:38:36+00:00", "date_published": "2026-05-11T01:29:20+00:00", "authors": [], "tags": []}, {"id": "https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/topics/10-gnmi-openconfig/gnoi-gnsi/", "url": "https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/topics/10-gnmi-openconfig/gnoi-gnsi/", "title": "gNOI / gNSI", "content_html": "gNOI / gNSI \u2014 gNOI (gRPC Network Operations Interface) \u306f\u3001\u8a2d\u5b9a\u8aad\u307f\u66f8\u304d (gNMI) \u306e\u96a3\u3067 reboot / OS install / file transfer / factory reset / healthz \u3068\u3044\u3063\u305f\u64cd\u4f5c RPC \u3092\u62c5\u5f53\u3057\u3001gNSI (gRPC Network Security Interface) \u304c\u8a3c\u660e\u66f8\u914d\u5e03\u30fb\u8a8d\u53ef\u30fbattestation \u3092\u62c5\u3046\u3002SONiC \u3067\u306f telemetry container \u5185\u306e gNMI server \u306b\u540c\u5c45\u3059\u308b\u3002", "image": "https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/assets/images/social/topics/10-gnmi-openconfig/gnoi-gnsi.png", "date_modified": "2026-06-06T14:38:36+00:00", "date_published": "2026-05-11T01:29:20+00:00", "authors": [], "tags": []}]}